      "amount": "1/4 teaspoon"
    },
    {
      "name": "fresh parsley",
      "amount": "1/4 cup",
      "notes": "chopped"
    }
  ],
  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the grill to 400 degrees Fahrenheit.",
    "In a large bowl, whisk together sriracha sauce, olive oil, lemon juice, garlic powder, paprika, salt, and black pepper.",
    "Add the chicken to the bowl and toss to coat with the marinade.",
    "Thread the chicken onto skewers, if desired.",
    "Grill the chicken for 5-6 minutes per side, or until cooked through.",
    "Transfer the chicken to a terracotta dish and garnish with chopped parsley.",
    "Serve hot and enjoy.",
    "Let the chicken rest for a few minutes before serving.",
    "Garnish with additional parsley, if desired."
  ],
